  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Heavenly Court’s deduction hall he praises Fairy Zi Wei for using a will to find clues to Fang Yuan, and he insists Fang Yuan must be eliminated after Spring Autumn Cicada is sealed.",
      "chapters": [
        1052
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the deduction hall he is an old Gu Immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        1052
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He travels with Wei Ling Yang and Bi Chen Tian as one of three Heavenly Court rank eights. He has higher seniority than Bi Chen Tian, and Duke Long recently gave him pointers that raised his strength again.",
      "chapters": [
        1239
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rescue-mission",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wei_ling_yang",
        "char_bi_chen_tian",
        "char_duke_long"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Facing a soul beast army in immemorial black heaven, he proposes his killer move dragon flow escape to carry himself, three Immortal Gu Houses, and many Gu Immortals. He warns he will not be able to fight for the next three days after using it. White dragon phantoms form a long river and force an opening. After a six hour chase he is spent, says he needs seven days of rest before he can do anything again, and sinks into deep sleep.",
      "chapters": [
        1244
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "killer-move-evacuates-group-from-army",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After a long dragon flow escape chase he turns pale, his vigorous eyes fill with blood traces, he falls into deep sleep, and his snore sounds like the roaring of dragons. As he sleeps, thick fog forms a cocoon that turns into a pale white dragon egg within two hours.",
      "chapters": [
        1244
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "exhaustion-form",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "While he sleeps, Bi Chen Tian alone holds Wind Sweeping Building through the ongoing crisis.",
      "chapters": [
        1245
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sleep-through-the-crisis",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_wind_sweeping_building"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the spaceless tunnel he wakes, and Wei Ling Yang says that since he is awake they will not stay any longer. The Central Continent Gu Immortals could have left the tunnel long ago, but they purposely stayed inside to wait for him to wake up. With him awake, Central Continent’s side has its full strength back with three rank eight Gu Immortals. A giant ghost face then blocks the tunnel and collapses it, and within a few breaths the hole that opens devours Canary Pavilion, which he is controlling.",
      "chapters": [
        1249
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wakes-and-loses-canary-pavilion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "house_canary_pavilion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Word spreads that Heavenly Court’s group failed to save Ma Hong Yun and took a crushing defeat in Northern Plains. Of its three rank eight Gu Immortals, Wei Ling Yang, Myriad Tidal Dragon and Bi Chen Tian, two are dead and one is unaccounted for, and the news does not say which is which.",
      "chapters": [
        1334
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "news-from-the-northern-plains-mission",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ma_hong_yun",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    }
  ],
